  "content": "<h3>關於</h3>\n<p>Lootr 的箱子模型使用 Nostalgic Tweaks 的模型。<br>\n<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnostalgic-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nostalgic Tweaks</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flootr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lootr</a> 是資源包所必需的。</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>設置</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>安裝兩個 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnostalgic-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nostalgic Tweaks</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flootr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lootr</a></li>\n<li>兩個 MOD 安裝完畢後，打開 Nostalgic Tweaks 的配置檔</li>\n<li>點選選單，然後點選 Eye Candy</li>\n<li>\"找出 Old Modded Chests 並按下編輯列表\"</li>\n<li>\"按加號加入所有三個 Loot 箱子\"</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/lootr-nostalgic-chests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/available/curseforge/cozy-minimal.svg\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252flootr-nostalgic-chests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/available/modrinth/cozy-minimal.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></p>",
